Subject: Re: Concatenating matched data sets to look at balance diagnostics for pooled data set
In-Reply-To: <CA+trajpGAhTSQxy6MHirbPC+Ai5=6sXSjVbrkki9+PDdpyPejg@mail.gmail.com>
