If I understand your question correctly, you can just change the rownames
of your dataset before you run matchit.

So use the same code as you have, but before you run matchit (but after you
load the dataset), just do

rownames(pscore) <- pscore$ID

assuming that your ID variable is a variable in pscore with the name "ID".


